  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Dual-Axis Joystick Module is a 2-channel analog input module. It automatically returns to the center. The dual-channel joystick is suitable for use as a control lever in various scenarios where control of both movement speed and direction is required, especially when these movements are interrelated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For example, in vehicle models, one axis is used to control the moving speed, and the other axis is used to control the steering; or in the model of a tower crane, one axis is used to control the rotation, and the other axis is used to control the distance of the trolley car."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Important Notices"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Included accessory: The product comes with a 100mm Wire with 3Pin SH1.0 Connectors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion."
    }
  ],
