oth movement speed and direction is required, especially when these movements are interrelated.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">For example, in vehicle models, one axis is used to control the moving speed, and the other axis is used to control the steering; or in the model of a tower crane, one axis is used to control the rotation, and the other axis is used to control the distance of the trolley car.</p>\n<!--Specification-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--Banner-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%;\"><!---图片链接替换----><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/a44d406e82bd4faf843ec7f7f22bc2c5/XA011.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px; width: 111.864%;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bol